# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository holds exactly two things: the frontend and the backend.
# Everything else at the root is ignored, so a working directory that also
# carries drafts, datasets or scratch files cannot leak them into a commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/snrm-frontend/
!/snrm-backend/

# Each project carries its own .gitignore for build output and local secrets;
# the entries below apply everywhere and are not repeated there.

# Editor and assistant scratch
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
